VERDICT: The reasoning layer holds together — step order, blueprint statuses, loop conditions, the three-part stop and the numbering crosswalk are consistent and carefully cross-referenced — but the enforcement layer is hollow, because the gate and the script read a schema no step produces, leaving the default-first and 20% machinery, the sabotage proof, the Tools of the five things and the test baseline as promises with no mechanism.
